  "notes": "Announced with the paper Language Models are Few-Shot Learners (arXiv v1 2020-05-28) and offered through the OpenAI API from 2020-06-11. The model index for researchers ties the API names davinci, curie and babbage to GPT-3 175B, 6.7B and 1B; ada is listed with them as a base GPT model on the deprecations page, which recommends davinci-002 and babbage-002 as replacements (not recorded here). The model card says the September 2020 version was retrained on data up to August 2020. Lifecycle and dates apply to the API models."
